{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Noctuary Free DLC: New Journey</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse in New Stories:</strong> Experience 6 exciting chapters consisting of 17 episodes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Mysteries &amp; Adventures:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Krosa Nonet from another continent, brings the famed local delicacy--\u2018Glase\u2019!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What led to the Crystal Family\u2019s sudden downfall? What secrets lie in their past?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enigmatic &quot;Light Knight&quot; is revealed as her partner?!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... ...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All unfolds in <strong>Noctuary Free DLC: New Journey</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[How to access the DLC]</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch Noctuary after updating.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the &quot;Story Archive&quot; entry at the bottom-left of the Quest interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Condition: To avoid spoilers, the first DLC story unlocks after completing Chapter 4's quest 'Revived Memories'. Subsequent stories unlock sequentially.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[About the DLC]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>[Krosa Nonet] \ud83e\udd4a</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Fists: &quot;Boom, boom, boom!&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glase: &quot;Gulp, gulp, gulp!&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will to live: &quot;I got it alllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllll!&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in the Inlixaland, I have my own way of fighting!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>[Lura Graves] \ud83c\udf3f</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark \u2192 Entangle \u2192 Eliminate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature and darkness grant her symbiotic control over the earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkritters... Not just foes...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<strong>[Kira Crimson] \u26a1</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swift Precision, One-Shot Kills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like crimson lightning,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She dances the dance of death in the dark.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879310?t=1758002779","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879310?t=1758002779","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879310/10deec6006bfdbbffcc11a746d60e29eb341c702/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758002779","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879310/10deec6006bfdbbffcc11a746d60e29eb341c702/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758002779","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Noctuary Free DLC: New Journey</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse in New Stories:</strong> Experience 6 exciting chapters consisting of 17 episodes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Mysteries &amp; Adventures:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Krosa Nonet from another continent, brings the famed local delicacy--\u2018Glase\u2019!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragrap